World Championship Wrestling is a promotion based out of Atlanta, Georgia in the United States. The sucessor promotion of Jim Crockett Promotions and at one point the flag bearer of the National Wrestling Alliance, WCW began 1991 as the clear #2 promotion in the United States. Despite that position however, WCW has suffered from a talent drain as many of the old NWA stars have left for the World Wrestling Federation. The failure of the AWA at the end of 1990 saw a few of that promotion's wrestlers make their way to WCW.
